# What the image build may see (Dockerfile). Everything is left out unless
# listed: the manifests, the two apps, the packages they use, and the
# migrations. Test files and the test helpers never reach the image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/api/**
!apps/migrate/**
!packages/core/**
!packages/platform/**
!db/**
**/*.test.ts
**/node_modules
